    "title": "Campton Hills Police Respond To Indictment Of Former Chief And Other Deputies - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Paul Stukel No Comments ,\n17 hours ago Yesterday, following last week’s announcement that four former and current police officers in the Campton Hills Police Department – including a former Chief of Police – have been indicted for selling firearms kept in evidence and falsifying reports to cover it up, CHPD issued its first public statement on the matter. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 6",
